# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored.

# Finnhub free tier — https://finnhub.io/register
# Required to fill the current-quarter gap (DERA publishes quarterly).
# FINNHUB_API_KEY=

# Tiingo free tier — https://www.tiingo.com/account/api/token
# Dual purpose: (1) fallback price provider when Yahoo rate-limits yfinance,
# (2) survivorship-bias fix — serves delisted / acquired tickers that Yahoo
# silently drops. Without this key, ~27% of cluster_buys signals on delisted
# names get excluded from backtests (inflates Sharpe). 500/hr, 2000/day free.
# TIINGO_API_KEY=

# Alpaca free data API — https://alpaca.markets/
# Unlocks real-time IEX quotes + trades (covers all US-listed equities but
# only from the IEX venue, ~2-3% of total volume). Powers the /live page.
# Email signup only, no credit card. Both values below required.
# ALPACA_API_KEY_ID=
# ALPACA_API_SECRET=
